\ cm/edit-shim.4 - what relfsh's line editor takes from shell/shell.4, for the command model's prompt (871:
\ Rill 2's, 835, with cm's prompt text). tools/build-cm-image.sh loads shell/edit.4 after this without its TAB
\ completion (its section cut out: 3.3 KB - cm/complete.4 is the language's own), so only what the rest of the editor uses is here. The characters' widths are
\ shell.4's own section, cut out by the build as for Rill's image.
4096 CONSTANT LINE-MAX
: ERR-TYPE ( c-addr u --- )   2 WRITE-FILE DROP ;
VARIABLE INT-SEEN?
DEFER HIST-NEXT-CALL                                     \ edit.4 sets it
DEFER ED-COMPLETE ( --- )                                \ TAB: cm/complete.4's, set once cm/cmc.4 is loaded (911)
VARIABLE PS1-WIDTH   VARIABLE PS2-WIDTH
: SH-PROMPT-PREPARE ( --- )   4 PS1-WIDTH !  5 PS2-WIDTH ! ;
: SH-PROMPT1 ( --- )   S" cm> " ERR-TYPE ;
: SH-PROMPT2 ( --- )   S" ...> " ERR-TYPE ;
